<span class="line"><span style="color:#E06C75;">          description</span><span style="color:#ABB2BF;">: </span><span style="color:#98C379;">&quot;时间不同步会引发证书校验、etcd 选主、日志对齐等问题，建议尽快恢复 chrony/ntp。&quot;</span></span>
